 "subs": [
  {
   "a": 0.47,
   "b": 2.872,
   "zh": "这是 Anthropic 官方放出的一段对谈",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 2.922,
   "b": 5.76,
   "zh": "主角是 Claude Code 团队的三位工程师",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 6.283,
   "b": 7.913,
   "zh": "负责提问的是 Thariq",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 8.434,
   "b": 10.411,
   "zh": "另外两位是 Sid 和 Robert",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 10.461,
   "b": 12.204,
   "zh": "Robert 正在做 Claude Tag",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 12.732,
   "b": 13.935,
   "zh": "做 Claude Code 的人",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 13.985,
   "b": 15.462,
   "zh": "自己怎么用 Claude Code？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 16.042,
   "b": 17.151,
   "zh": "答案先放在前面",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 17.201,
   "b": 19.802,
   "zh": "他们已经不给它下指令了，只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 20.322,
   "b": 21.292,
   "zh": "这句话站得住吗？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 21.862,
   "b": 23.753,
   "zh": "站得住，但有一个前提",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 23.803,
   "b": 26.082,
   "zh": "模型得先好到，让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 26.606,
   "b": 27.424,
   "zh": "分三步看",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 27.474,
   "b": 31.113,
   "zh": "第一，人怎么从盯过程，变成只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 31.163,
   "b": 35.236,
   "zh": "第二，做出来的功能，为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 35.286,
   "b": 37.406,
   "zh": "第三，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 37.928,
   "b": 38.438,
   "zh": "第一步",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 39.008,
   "b": 40.255,
   "zh": "Sid 七八成的工作",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 40.305,
   "b": 42.788,
   "zh": "都在 Slack 里的 Claude Tag 上完成",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 44.391,
   "b": 46.391,
   "zh": "以前在意每一次工具调用、",
   "en": "caring about each individual tool call",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 46.391,
   "b": 48.891,
   "zh": "模型做的每一个决定；",
   "en": "and each individual decision that the model makes",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 48.891,
   "b": 54.191,
   "zh": "现在退远一步：我有一个目标，我想把它达成。",
   "en": "to just zoomed out view of like, I have a goal and I'd like to achieve this goal.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 54.891,
   "b": 58.491,
   "zh": "然后把这个目标交给模型，让它替你完成。",
   "en": "And you just kind of give that goal to the model to achieve for you.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 58.961,
   "b": 60.467,
   "zh": "这一步只要记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 60.517,
   "b": 63.061,
   "zh": "交给它一个目标，步骤让它自己排",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 63.633,
   "b": 66.283,
   "zh": "第二步，功能为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 66.789,
   "b": 70.789,
   "zh": "给它五件事，做完三件就放弃了。",
   "en": "You'd give it like five things to do and it would do three things and just give up.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 71.389,
   "b": 74.789,
   "zh": "我们就想：要不给它一张待办清单？效果很好。",
   "en": "So we were like, oh, maybe you give it a to-do list and it'll do really well.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 74.789,
   "b": 78.989,
   "zh": "可一年后，它就消失了，待办清单已经用不上了。",
   "en": "But a year from then, it's disappeared. You don't really need the to-do list anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 78.989,
   "b": 84.089,
   "zh": "你得对自己做的东西毫不留恋，",
   "en": "…you got to be very unattached to the things you're building",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 84.089,
   "b": 86.889,
   "zh": "因为它们很快就会消失。",
   "en": "because they're going to go away fairly quickly.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 87.359,
   "b": 89.659,
   "zh": "底层模型，每两个月就换一次",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 90.239,
   "b": 91.479,
   "zh": "Thariq 的说法是—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 91.529,
   "b": 91.649,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 92.151,
   "b": 97.651,
   "zh": "某种程度上，我们就是软件开发未来的「精神时光屋」。",
   "en": "So I think in some ways, we're this hyperbolic time chamber of where software development is going.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 98.121,
   "b": 99.319,
   "zh": "这一步记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 99.369,
   "b": 102.171,
   "zh": "今天救命的功能，明年可能就是包袱",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 102.744,
   "b": 104.714,
   "zh": "第三步，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 105.284,
   "b": 106.752,
   "zh": "以前审代码是这样的—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 106.802,
   "b": 106.904,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 107.406,
   "b": 111.106,
   "zh": "审代码的人会挑出三个小毛病发上去，",
   "en": "and they would pick out three little nitpicks to post.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 111.406,
   "b": 115.106,
   "zh": "其实就是在告诉你：这段代码我看过了。",
   "en": "It was kind of just like, I'm signaling to you that I read this code.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 115.106,
   "b": 120.506,
   "zh": "现在，这些小问题可以交给 Claude 自己找、自己改。",
   "en": "Now, you can have Claude figure out those little things and address them autonomously.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 120.906,
   "b": 123.806,
   "zh": "这已经不是人审代码的重点了。",
   "en": "That's not really the important part of human code review anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 124.276,
   "b": 127.074,
   "zh": "现在，人只盯 Claude 没想明白的",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 127.124,
   "b": 129.416,
   "zh": "接口怎么设计，边界划在哪",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 129.996,
   "b": 131.501,
   "zh": "在 Claude Tag 里",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 131.551,
   "b": 133.208,
   "zh": "连它每一步在想什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 133.258,
   "b": 134.156,
   "zh": "都看不到了",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 134.66,
   "b": 137.96,
   "zh": "这层抽象，一开始有点吓人。",
   "en": "And that abstraction was like a little scary to get through at first.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 138.06,
   "b": 141.16,
   "zh": "我看不到 Claude 当下在想的每一件事。",
   "en": "I can't see everything that Claude is thinking as it's thinking it.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 141.16,
   "b": 144.96,
   "zh": "就像被逼着放手，让它自己发挥。",
   "en": "And like being forced even to let Claude cook.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 145.43,
   "b": 146.746,
   "zh": "回到开头那个判断",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 146.796,
   "b": 149.65,
   "zh": "站得住，因为模型已经好到让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 150.22,
   "b": 153.161,
   "zh": "模型每两个月换一次，你搭的流程迟早要拆",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 153.211,
   "b": 155.68,
   "zh": "能留下来的，只有你给它的那个目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  }
 ],
